      "hours": "hour",
      "day": "day from experiment origin",
      "count": "capacity unit"
    },
    "assumptions": [
      "All starter quantities are fictional teaching inputs, not measured performance or real organizational outcomes.",
      "These conditions govern commissioning the experiment. They do not determine whether the existing reporting team can cover its work.",
